ting, artifact versioning, deployment checks and operational monitoring. Define health indicators and recovery steps appropriate to the application. Verify normal operation and failure behaviour after deployment.\n\nACCEPTANCE CRITERIA\nThe implementation must preserve the project's existing contracts, pass relevant automated tests, behave predictably for invalid and boundary conditions, provide actionable diagnostics and remain maintainable by another engineer."
